"""Romance-article detector for one MLP neuron-direction in layer 0.

What it does: this component goes strongly negative on Spanish / Italian / Portuguese
(and French) articles and article-contractions that open a noun phrase: "del", "do",
"al", "un", "dell'", "della", "nel", "dal", "da", "dos", ..., and mildly positive on a few
Romance words ("per", "io", "te"). Those effects only show up when the text so far is
Romance: the same tokens in English ("et al.", "What do you", "of the") give ~0.

The gate is the share of Romance vs English function words in the current document so
far. Words are counted before the current token, and the counts reset at each new document.
