"""Component layers.0.mlp.down_proj:3944: a negative "after" detector.

It writes a strongly negative value on the English word "after" (any case, also
"afterward(s)", "thereafter"), a smaller negative value on "after" in other languages,
and a weak negative value on the temporal conjunctions "when", "once", "upon", "whenever".
On every other token it is 0. The value depends on the word alone, not on its context.
