"""A sparse spelling approximation plus small grammatical/location responses.

Registered signs and i-diaeresis dominate the selected high-response examples.
We retain smaller marked-letter and delimiter responses, and a weak negative
baseline for spatial words and gendered pronouns. Everything else is zero.
